  "notes": "Dark navy Material UI theme (#1f2d3d page, #253649 panel) with light-blue #90caf9 accent for primary button, links/subtitle, category/entity icons and value pills. Each row has two lines: Flow pairs from/to account arrows (blue left, blue right; green right for transfer targets) with small account-type icons. Description shows bold-ish merchant text plus category icon+name and entity icon+name, with an optional outlined tag chip (tax-deductible). Value pills are rounded outline chips: blue for expenses, white for transfers. In the Date column, the day number is bold and the month is lighter; some dates are muted grey. Rows alternate between the #1f2d3d and #253649 backgrounds with thin dividers. Edit opens a modal form (Expense/Transfer/Income segmented control, split transaction); this is not in the capture. The sidebar's Meta group expands to Categories/Entities/Tags/Rules."
